## Why This Is Asked
Tests for REST + streaming under multi-tenant data PODs with failure modes are common in high-scale apps; this checks reliability, isolation, and observability.

## Key Concepts
- Contract testing (Pact/OpenAPI)
- Cursor pagination correctness
- Streaming dedup / backpressure
- Fault injection / resilience
- Multi-tenant data isolation and security
- Observability and tracing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-test: subscribe to /stream and verify deduplicated events
const stream = fetchStream(`/users/${uid}/transactions/stream`);
const seen = new Set();
for await (const evt of stream) {
  if (seen.has(evt.id)) throw new Error('Dedup');
  seen.add(evt.id);
}
```

